.md
## TraditionalForm
We implemented `TraditionalForm`, which was missing from WLJS. Under the hood, it attempts to convert expressions to LaTeX and render them in the output.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## TraditionalForm
We implemented `TraditionalForm`, which was missing from WLJS. Under the hood, it attempts to convert expressions to LaTeX and render them in the output.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Integrate[f[x], x] // TraditionalForm

